<title>USA: Asia Tigers Fund Q1 Jan 31 earnings.</title>
<headline>Asia Tigers Fund Q1 Jan 31 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asia Tigers Fund Inc Wednesday reported first-quarter net investment income of $26,357, or $0.01 per share.</p>
<p>Net realized and unrealized gains were $28,825,844, or $1.41 per share.</p>
<p>Total assets of the fund were $275.8 million at the end of the quarter, January 31.</p>
